      "status": "dropped",
      "decision": {
        "note": "PromQL dropped by the user. It required ClickHouse's TimeSeries table fed by Prometheus remote-write, with no Couchbase equivalent in scope. Disabled in Phase 5a; code deleted in Phase 10.",
